How to say "happy birthday" + talk about your birthday 🎂🇫🇷

• un anniversaire = a birthday
• joyeux anniversaire = happy birthday
• un gâteau = a cake
• une fête = a party
• en avance = early / in advance

💌 Save this for your next birthday chat
👯 Send it to someone with a birthday coming up

